WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,830
Well done, second auntie

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:06,230
What will happen after Master Chen seals Tangkou?

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:08,230
He has three lives on his hands

4
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,430
They forced five people to be banned

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,030
I can only atone for my sins for the rest of my life

6
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,950
From now on, I can seal the mouth of anyone I want to.

7
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:17,350
Then you should be banned by then. You are still young.

8
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:20,150
I don't know what this means. It's time to wake up.

9
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:21,710
Second aunt’s words

10
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,230
Why does it sound like farewell?

11
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,560
I just had a phone call with my ex-life

12
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,960
Master Chen sealed

13
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,720
It was sealed just after you sealed Tangkou.

14
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:34,370
This is what happened to Feng Tang

15
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:35,570
I feel like I did something wrong

16
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,450
He suffered evil causes and suffered evil consequences

17
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:45,860
It’s also a form of granting. Who should we look for, Master Liu?

18
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,580
It's so hard to find you

19
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,180
Don’t answer the phone, don’t reply to messages

20
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,340
What do you mean? Sister He

21
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,020
I have said many times that I don’t want to see marriage.

22
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,540
A shaky person

23
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:58,700
Believe it or not, give me a call

24
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,700
Smash your broken house, Sister He

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:02,530
I can't see marriage

26
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:05,100
But I can show your son something else

27
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,980
Is your son suffering from snow disaster?

28
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,440
You tell him again

29
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:14,180
My master is right

30
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,100
You do have a snow disaster

31
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:17,540
You might lose half your life

32
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,480
His disaster was related to water

33
00:01:30,110 --> 00:01:32,630
This four hundred is considered too much money to pay for affairs, so I won’t charge it.

34
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,140
One last word for you

35
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:37,350
Your disaster is related to water

36
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,200
Just say two sentences and it's over

37
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:49,850
Who should I drink here?

38
00:01:50,890 --> 00:01:51,930
Also considered water
